      "widgets_values": [
        "## Flux img2img denoise 0.65 (lab)\n\nWhat this graph does: Medium **sketch → incredible** remaster of Comfy **example.png** (denoise 0.65).\nModels: flux-2-klein-9b-nvfp4 + qwen_3_8b_fp4mixed (CLIP type flux2) + flux2-vae.\nSampler: euler · simple · CFG 1.0 · 8 steps · denoise 0.65.\nSaveImage prefix: ez_flux_img2img.\nDefault LoadImage: **example.png** (pink dress / yellow wing-hair stick figure on green hill).\n\nDemo thesis: same silhouette and color blocks as the trash doodle, elevated into a rich illustration.\n\nPrompting (Flux.2 Klein + Qwen3 TE):\n• Restate dress, wing-hair, pose, hill, sky, then upgrade materials and light.\n• Prefer positive craft language over “no X”.\n\nHow to run:\n1. Keep example.png (or use your own bad sketch).\n2. Queue; try subtle (0.35) and strong (0.85) siblings for the denoise ladder."
      ],
      "title": "Flux img2img denoise 0.65 (lab) — operator note"
    }
